  data: {
    LLM: '1. **Contracts**: Each hand has a specific contract to fulfill before melding.\n2. **The Call**: Any player can call for a discard out of turn. If accepted, they must take the discard PLUS a penalty card from the stock. (Limit: 3 calls per hand).\n3. **Melds**: Threes (sets) and Fours (runs). Jokers are wild.\n4. **Pointing**: Jokers (25), Black Aces (15), K-Q-J-10 (10), 2-9 (Face), Red Aces (1). Lowest total wins.',
    Player: '1. **Contracts**: Each hand has a specific contract to fulfill before melding.\n2. **The Call**: Any player can call for a discard out of turn. If accepted, they must take the discard PLUS a penalty card from the stock. (Limit: 3 calls per hand).\n3. **Melds**: Threes (sets) and Fours (runs). Jokers are wild.\n4. **Pointing**: Jokers (25), Black Aces (15), K-Q-J-10 (10), 2-9 (Face), Red Aces (1). Lowest total wins.',
    objective: "Be the first to 'Go Out' by melding all cards in your hand and have the lowest total score after 9 hands.",
    gameplay: '1. **Contracts**: Each hand has a specific contract to fulfill before melding.\n2. **The Call**: Any player can call for a discard out of turn. If accepted, they must take the discard PLUS a penalty card from the stock. (Limit: 3 calls per hand).\n3. **Melds**: Threes (sets) and Fours (runs). Jokers are wild.\n4. **Pointing**: Jokers (25), Black Aces (15), K-Q-J-10 (10), 2-9 (Face), Red Aces (1). Lowest total wins.',
